{"id":"r7qmnc24pe1o5mo6odi7ukhtu","title":"金融行动特别工作组启动加密反洗钱专项审查，首批结果定于2027年6月公布","originalTitle":"FATF 启动加密反洗钱专项审查，首批结果 2027 年 6 月公布","summary":"金融行动特别工作组（FATF）宣布启动针对加密资产服务规模较大辖区的反洗钱专项审查，首批结果将于2027年6月公布，并配套建立持续监测机制。该审查将评估各国执行全球反洗钱标准的进展，主要依据辖区虚拟资产服务提供商的实质重要性及现有评估状态。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"链捕手 ChainCatcher"},"links":{"original":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2301062"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-02T13:17:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-02T14:02:38.706Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-02T14:02:38.706Z","category":"crypto-policy","tags":["监管处罚","政策发布"],"score":91,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"f80fc518-7ed1-41fc-86f9-d14ef92b701d","title":"FATF启动加密反洗钱专项审查 首批结果2027年6月公布"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"f80fc518-7ed1-41fc-86f9-d14ef92b701d","title":"FATF启动加密反洗钱专项审查 首批结果2027年6月公布"}],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fCEOlwG9vY6E","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}